---
/**
 * /disclaimer — the full disclaimer, including the site's limits.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, disclaimer } from '../config/site';
import { href } from '../lib/url';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="The full disclaimer for Arthanomy: research not advice, no recommendations, estimates labelled, sources open for verification."
  path="/disclaimer"
>
  <header class="shell pt-10">
    <p class="eyebrow">Disclaimer</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Read this before acting on anything here</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="shell article-body mt-8 max-w-3xl pb-16">
    <p>{disclaimer.long}</p>

    <h2>No recommendations, no personalised advice</h2>
    <p>
      The author is not a SEBI-registered investment adviser, research analyst, portfolio manager or broker. Nothing
      on this site — including comparisons, calculator outputs, worked examples or research on specific avenues — is a
      recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security or product, or advice for your circumstances. Content is
      educational research and general information.
    </p>

    <h2>Estimates are estimates</h2>
    <p>
      Any future return, probability, drawdown or tax outcome shown on this site is a model output: a function of
      assumptions that are printed alongside it. Model outputs are wrong by construction — the question is only how
      wrong and in which direction. Historical figures are labelled with their period and source; where data was
      unavailable, the site says so rather than supplying a number.
    </p>

    <h2>Verify before acting</h2>
    <p>
      Tax and regulatory positions change; scheme terms change; product availability changes. Before acting on anything
      read here, verify it against the primary source cited — the registry at
      <a href={href('/sources')}>/sources</a> links to the official documents — or consult a registered professional.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      Links to external sites are provided for verification and are not endorsements. Arthanomy is not responsible for
      the content, accuracy or practices of external sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, the author accepts no liability for any loss or damage arising from
      use of this site or reliance on its content. If that is not acceptable, the correct decision is not to use the
      site for investment decisions.
    </p>

    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-faint)]">
      Contact for questions about this disclaimer: <a href={`mailto:${site.author.email}`}>{site.author.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
